call decrementDisconnectedSseCall decrementActiveSseClients
run decrementDisconnectedSseCall
ignore value source decrementDisconnectedSseCall type CSignedInt64
return value runtime.authSuccessCode

label sseStreamWriteFailed
call incrementSlowDropCall incrementSseSlowClientDropsTotal
run incrementSlowDropCall
ignore value source incrementSlowDropCall type CSignedInt64
call closeFailedSseStreamCall http.closeSseStream
argument closeFailedSseStreamCall response HttpResponse response
run closeFailedSseStreamCall
ignore value source closeFailedSseStreamCall type CSignedInt32
call decrementFailedSseCall decrementActiveSseClients
run decrementFailedSseCall
ignore value source decrementFailedSseCall type CSignedInt64
return value runtime.authSuccessCode

label sseDatabaseUnavailable
call sseDatabaseUnavailableWriteCall helpers.writeDatabaseUnavailableEnvelope
argument sseDatabaseUnavailableWriteCall response HttpResponse response
run sseDatabaseUnavailableWriteCall
bind value sseDatabaseUnavailableStatus CSignedInt32 sseDatabaseUnavailableWriteCall
